    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The brutal orcs have taken over the resort city.<br>Chosen as a Bikini Warrior, you\u2019ve decided to fight back.<br>Eliminate all the orcs around you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple, yet incredibly exhilarating action</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game controls and system are very simple and easy to learn.<br>However, the exhilarating action that responds to player input immerses you in fierce brawls with the orcs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect Guard System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Successfully guard just before the enemy's attack to trigger a Perfect Guard!<br> Reduce incoming damage and seize a powerful counterattack opportunity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fatal Finish! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Drive the orcs into a corner and finish them with a Fatal Finish!<br>Land an overwhelming blow, recover your health, and feel refreshed!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Bikini Warriors </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/4a2e351943fe1d28e740e238129b74f6.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/4a2e351943fe1d28e740e238129b74f6.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/4a2e351943fe1d28e740e238129b74f6.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As the story progresses, you can recruit new bikini warriors.<br>Hunt orcs with a variety of unique bikini fighters!<br><br>Experience the ultimate in hot and wild bikini action.<br>Now, let\u2019s go kill some orcs!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/b8e3ab1773aa544db73848e207cec920.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The brutal orcs have taken over the resort city.<br>Chosen as a Bikini Warrior, you\u2019ve decided to fight back.<br>Eliminate all the orcs around you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple, yet incredibly exhilarating action</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/f1a366fe903194a8880f0f4d1b8518f5.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game controls and system are very simple and easy to learn.<br>However, the exhilarating action that responds to player input immerses you in fierce brawls with the orcs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect Guard System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/81c8bef5caa4f75cb0c823ab810ba9f3.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Successfully guard just before the enemy's attack to trigger a Perfect Guard!<br> Reduce incoming damage and seize a powerful counterattack opportunity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fatal Finish! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/0c1a159303fba58419a8e202d1050d33.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Drive the orcs into a corner and finish them with a Fatal Finish!<br>Land an overwhelming blow, recover your health, and feel refreshed!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Bikini Warriors </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/4a2e351943fe1d28e740e238129b74f6.poster.avif?t=1755741600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/4a2e351943fe1d28e740e238129b74f6.webm?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829570/extras/4a2e351943fe1d28e740e238129b74f6.mp4?t=1755741600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As the story progresses, you can recruit new bikini warriors.<br>Hunt orcs with a variety of unique bikini fighters!<br><br>Experience the ultimate in hot and wild bikini action.<br>Now, let\u2019s go kill some orcs!",
